body:
@stefanmb Thanks for using Elasticsearch, and your detailed assessment. It looks like the issue is this bit of code to remove file settings state:
```
 else if (fileSettingsMetadata != null) {
    mdBuilder.removeReservedState(fileSettingsMetadata);
}
```

That predates the readiness service depending on file settings. In this base case we should now be doing the equivalent of `stateService.initEmpty(...)` like we do when starting the service and no file is present.
